    rows+=['','Human final export SHA256 `'+ratings['export_sha256']+'`; private DB backup SHA256 `'+ratings['private_database_sha256']+'`. The DB is retained locally and intentionally excluded from this shareable audit package because it contains account hashes.','', '## Deliberate exclusions and limits','', 'The19.3GB public Qwen weight shards were **not duplicated onto the user computer**. Their exact official revision c202236235762e1c871ad0ccb60c8ee5ba337b9a, four shard hashes, post-execution hash receipt and small model/processor/configuration files are backed up. A future run requires downloading those public weights again. Re-download availability is not independently guaranteed indefinitely. Venvs/package caches and compiled kernels are reinstallable from backed-up environment/version/setup records and are not counted as unique research artifacts. Credentials, private keys and system management state are outside research-backup scope.','', 'Backups were verified on the user computer, outside the instance. This audit does not certify a second offsite HF/cloud replica. A lost user disk would be a separate risk; destroying this Vast instance does not remove these verified local copies. Original photos are the retained publisher CDN renditions, not claimed camera-original/high-resolution files. No model-quality judgment, participant-identity authentication or new research result is inferred from preservation checks.','', 'The inventory covered /workspace research files and Stage P supervisor definitions, with an additional non-hidden research-extension scan of /root,/home,/tmp,/opt/workspace-internal. It is not a forensic examination of hidden/system files. No unknown research candidates or scan errors were found in this scope.','', 'No destruction authorization was exercised. You may remove this exact instance with respect to the verified research-backup requirement; this report is a preservation receipt, not provider confirmation of destruction.']
